<title>CROATIA: TENNIS-CROATIA BEAT MOROCCO 4-1 IN DAVIS CUP TIE.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-CROATIA BEAT MOROCCO 4-1 IN DAVIS CUP TIE.</headline>
<dateline>OSIJEK, Croatia 1997-02-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Croatia beat Morocco 4-1</p>
<p>in their Davis Cup Euro/African zone group one tie on Sunday</p>
<p>after winning both reverse singles.</p>
<p>Results:</p>
<p>Goran Ivanisevic beat Karim Alami 6-2 7-5</p>
<p>Hicham Arazi beat Sasha Hirszon 6-1 6-4</p>
</text>
